  speakerName: Ariel
  dialogueNodes:
  - dialogueText: Actually, no, why would I want to leave the village? I have everything
      I need here...
    dialogueChoises: []
  - dialogueText: Plus, I've heard stories that people outside the village weren't
      very friendly... and... I'm a little afraid.
    dialogueChoises: []
  - dialogueText: So I'll live my life here, protecting my land like a noble man!!
    dialogueChoises: []
